:"阿修罗胸罩","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000D87|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aaaAsurasBra"},{"original":"Asura's Stockings","string":"阿修罗长袜","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000D88|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aaaAsurasSocks"},{"original":"Asura's Guard Manual","string":"阿修罗守护手册","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"0300081A|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"BOOK FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aaaAsurasSketch"},{"original":"<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\">\r\n","string":"<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\">\r\n","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"0300081A|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"BOOK DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"aaaAsurasSketch"},{"original":"Asura's Manual Page","string":"阿修罗手册书页","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000829|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"BOOK FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aaaAsuraLoosePage"},{"original":"<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><font size='18'>\r\nAsura's Guard Crafting-System\r\n\r\nRead the full 'Asura's Guard Manual' and you will gain the knowledge to brew 3 different potions at the smithing station.\r\nAlways stay hydrated while working at the forge.\r\n\r\nRules:\r\n\r\n- As long you POSSESS one of the potions, you can craft or modify Asura's Guard.\r\n  So do NOT DRINK them until the work is done.\r\n\r\n- When you are done with smithing, you can drink them or throw them away.\r\n  You are now always able to brew them.\r\n\r\n\r\nDifferent Potions:\r\n\r\n- Asura's Guard Craft\r\n  You can craft Asura's Guard parts with their required smithing materials.\r\n\r\n- Asura's Guard Morph\r\n  You can modify some parts. For example make Heels to Sabatons.\r\n  You can also make the minor pieces to one combined armor set.\r\n\r\n- Asura's Guard Scrap\r\n  You can scrap the combined armor to make it to many minor pieces again \r\n\r\n(You can throw this page away)\r\n</font>\r\n","string":"<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><font size='18'>\r\n阿修罗守护制作系统\r\n\r\n阅读完整的《阿修罗守护手册》，你便能掌握在锻造台调制 3 种不同药水的知识。\r\n在锻炉前工作时务必保持水分。\r\n\r\n规则：\r\n\r\n- 只要你持有任意一种药水，就能制作或改造阿修罗守护。\r\n  因此在工作完成之前，请勿饮用它们。\r\n\r\n- 锻造完成后，你可以饮用或丢弃它们。\r\n  此后你便能随时调制这些药水。\r\n\r\n\r\n不同药水：\r\n\r\n- 阿修罗守护·制作\r\n  你可以用所需的锻造材料制作阿修罗守护的各个部件。\r\n\r\n- 阿修罗守护·塑形\r\n  你可以改造部分部件，例如把高跟鞋改成铁靴。\r\n  也可以把小件组合成一套完整护甲。\r\n\r\n- 阿修罗守护·拆解\r\n  你可以拆解组合护甲，把它重新分成许多小件。\r\n\r\n（本页可以丢弃）\r\n</font>\r\n","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000829|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"BOOK DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"aaaAsuraLoosePage"},{"original":"Asura's Guard Scrap","string":"阿修罗守护拆解","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000800|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"MISC FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aaaSmeltAsuraCombinedMats"},{"original":"Asura's Guard","string":"阿修罗守护","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000816|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"FLOR FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aabAsuraDeadBody"},{"original":"Take","string":"拿取","status":"TranslationIncomplete","form_id":"03000816|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"FLOR RNAM","index":null,"editor_id":"aabAsuraDeadBody"},{"original":"Asura's Guard Manual","string":"阿修罗守护手册","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"0300081C|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"FLOR FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aaaAsuraSketchPlacement"},{"original":"Take","string":"拿取","status":"TranslationIncomplete","form_id":"0300081C|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"FLOR RNAM","index":null,"editor_id":"aaaAsuraSketchPlacement"},{"original":"Asura's Guard Crafting","string":"阿修罗守护制作","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000814|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"ALCH FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aabzUnlockAsuraList"},{"original":"Asura's Guard Morph","string":"阿修罗守护塑形","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000825|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"ALCH FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aabzUnlockAsuraMorphList"},{"original":"Asura's Guard Scrap","string":"阿修罗守护拆解","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"03000826|Asuras Guard [Armor].esp","type":"ALCH FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"aabzUnlockAsuraSmeltList"},{"original":"Hag's End","string":"鬼婆之终","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"00059398|Skyrim.esm","type":"CELL FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"HagsEnd01"},{"original":"Skyrim","string":"天际","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"0000003C|Skyrim.esm","type":"WRLD FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"Tamriel"}]